WEBVTT

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.500
Who are you?

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:34.840
Well, who are you?

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.720
I'm Chrono.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:41.510
I'm what you people call a devil.

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:45.810
What do you mean, a devil?

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:53.150
Just what I said,
a thing that you humans fear.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.820
Hey, are you all right?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.870
I don't suppose you're hungry?

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.160
Here you are, eat up!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.340
Thank you.

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:18.010
I'm Rosette.
This is my younger brother, Joshua.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.260
Nice to meet you.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:22.300
Hey, would it be all right if I shook your hand?

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:26.350
Are you really a devil?!

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:27.520
Yeah...

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:31.440
Wow! This is so cool!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.320
Aion...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.040
Joshua, don't go!

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:03.260
Joshua...

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.320
Hey, Rosette.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.080
How do you feel about Chrono?

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:31.080
Well, you're always together.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:34.920
Listen, Claire says she
wants to work with Chrono too.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:40.340
Oh, Anna, I simply said
that he was wonderful, that's all.

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.840
Hey, really, how do you feel?

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:48.470
How? I don't really.
Oh, man, what are you guys thinking?

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.310
I'm sorry.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.610
Chrono, good morning!

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:05.740
Hey, Rosette, good morning.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:07.990
Where's Elder?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:11.120
If you're looking for Elder, he's inside.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:13.830
Although it looks like he was up all night.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:33.430
Oh, Rosette.

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:36.390
This is the result of your all-nighter?

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.360
Yeah, I call it "Spirit"!

00:05:40.230 --> 00:05:41.860
Spirit?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:45.740
Would you take it over to Sister Kate for me?

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.030
Okay!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.450
Be sure to hand it over!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:51.370
You don't trust me? You're one to talk.

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.370
Didn't you recently filch the Gospel?

00:05:57.040 --> 00:06:01.210
Well, to be honest,
I'd be more at ease if Chrono did it,

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:04.550
but with how much Sister Kate dislikes him...

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:07.340
It can't be helped. After all, I'm

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.220
Oh, I'm tired of hearing that!

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:14.220
In what world will you find a charming devil
that is gallant morning, noon, or night,

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:16.640
and that will do the cooking and cleaning?!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.560
Anyone would be frightened.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.520
Although, Rosette was an exception.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:25.230
Hey, what kind of bullet is it this time?

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:27.070
There's a devil inside it.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:35.200
To be precise,
at the time of impact, the devil is released,

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.460
which produces an enormous amount
of mystical energy to strike your enemy.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.960
What happens to the devil?

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:43.750
The devil, as it were,
is changed into a spiritual kind of energy.

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:46.300
It goes "boom!" at the same
time the mystical energy is released,

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:47.760
and is annihilated.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:53.140
I think that it would be best not to use that.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.140
Because there's a devil inside?

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:02.270
It's all right. Even Elder wouldn't make
it into a bullet if it were dangerous, right?

00:07:13.700 --> 00:07:16.370
Maybe I'll fire a test round.

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:21.540
Rosette! We've got marching orders!

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.770
Monster!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.320
Sorry to keep you waiting!
Delivery from the Magdalene Order!

00:07:58.540 --> 00:07:59.870
Please step back!

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.210
You two again?

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:07.290
Aim for the horn!
Even the Sacred should be enough to break it!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:22.520
All it did was make it madder!

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.350
Concentrate on one point!

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.370
This will end it!

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.170
Rosette, that's not good!

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.500
It's all right, it's wisdom, wisdom!

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.550
This is just like what you did before, right?

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:09.940
Because it lost its horn?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:26.000
Well, continuing on from
last time, you two really are something.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:34.970
It's not here.

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:38.430
All right,then.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:40.970
Well?

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.930
It's not here.

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:50.270
Let's try searching in a wider area.

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:55.320
That gun was loaded
with the Spirit, wasn't it?

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:56.950
Yeah.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.110
Why?

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:05.080
Because I thought it might go
as well as it did at the harbor last time.

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:51.670
I see. Then just like the case from before...

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:55.500
The host was a devil worshipper after all.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.010
Another devil worshipper?

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.800
I'll submit a detailed report soon.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.350
Where is the devil's broken horn?

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:08.680
We submitted it to Elder.

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:10.520
A very appropriate decision.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.650
In a way, this is almost disappointing.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:22.490
This may be the first time I haven't
shouted at you during a mission debriefing.

00:11:22.490 --> 00:11:26.540
It is a wonderful thing, Sister Rosette.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.500
Thank you very much.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:30.330
In any case, good work.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.080
From now on,
please do your best, in this manner.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.420
Yes, Ma'am. Excuse me.

00:11:44.850 --> 00:11:48.520
Oh, I just lied.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.560
Lord, please forgive me.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:11:59.860
Rosette...

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.280
Right now, Elder is making a sensor
that will find the whereabouts of the Spirit

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.330
by detecting its mystical power.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.750
I'm sorry, Elder.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:13.000
Don't be like that! It's not like you.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.630
Remington?

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:25.470
So that was what really happened.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.770
I'm sorry.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:35.100
You weren't acting the way you normally
do when you're before Sister Kate, so...

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.440
I can't lie to you, can I, Minister Remington?

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:42.360
I'll keep it a secret from Sister Kate.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.490
I'll help too.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.100
Who's there?

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:20.940
Is it this?

00:13:22.280 --> 00:13:26.660
I can hear the voice of
the hornless one from inside of it.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.870
All right, it's finished!

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:42.000
It's a satisfactory creation!

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:49.010
Is that really going to be useful?

00:13:49.010 --> 00:13:51.350
I get the feeling that it's not quite reliable.

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:54.980
How rude! I said that
it's a satisfactory creation!

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:56.390
Switch on!

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.610
Elder?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:04.360
It seems that the Spirit is close by.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.570
It couldn't be!

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:28.180
Stop!

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:32.100
A person?

00:14:32.100 --> 00:14:34.600
Halt! Who are you?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.650
You're late.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:52.070
There is an unusually thick
evil hanging about that man!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:54.410
The Militia will surround the intruder.

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:56.370
Be prepared for anything.

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:59.250
However, only Sacred rounds will be permitted.

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:00.290
Yes, Ma'am!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.880
Class three and higher
exorcists, support the Militia!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:04.880
Yes, Ma'am!

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.390
An exorcist's Government .45?!

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:17.930
Why is that gun...?

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.440
Stop it!

00:15:39.450 --> 00:15:41.080
It's him!

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.960
The devil we saw this afternoon!

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:44.790
You have permission to fire the Sacred!

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.060
He's absorbed
the mystical power of the Spirit!

00:16:07.320 --> 00:16:10.190
He's completed himself
with it, in place of his broken horn!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:18.740
Attack!

00:16:33.090 --> 00:16:35.760
You want this, don't you? Follow me!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.970
All right, everyone, open fire on him.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:44.020
Please wait! I'll take care of him!

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:45.310
No! Come back!

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:49.770
I've got you!

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:54.780
Rosette!

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:19.680
What have you done?

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:23.310
You, who have no rank, and no name,
you who are of the lowest standing...

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.730
How dare you do that to my dear contractor?!

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.230
And now she's not moving!

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:38.620
Chrono...

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.410
What's happening to him?

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.080
You have permission to use the Gospel!

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.450
But with the Gospel's power,

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:46.000
there is a chance that Chrono
and Rosette might get caught in it!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:48.210
We cannot let the seal be broken!

00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:49.500
Chrono actually is...

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.710
Please wait!

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:53.250
Would you please wait
until Chrono moves away?

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:55.720
He no longer possesses
reason or anything else!

00:18:04.220 --> 00:18:06.690
His existence truly is dangerous!

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:09.600
Whatever else he may be,
he's still a powerful devil!

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.060
Devil?!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:14.400
Then, should the worst happen, I will...

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.460
Come back, Chrono! I'm okay, I'm okay!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.110
Why is she able to trust a devil?

00:18:57.110 --> 00:19:01.530
Rosette doesn't think
of Chrono as a devil, Sister.

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:03.530
Then what would you call him?

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.830
There, look and you'll understand.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.170
For now,

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.330
all we can do is watch over them.

00:19:13.630 --> 00:19:14.630
For now...

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:31.600
Lord Joshua...

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.480
Hey, Fiore.

00:19:35.020 --> 00:19:38.530
Just now, there was a call from Lord Aion.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.360
He said that he would call again later.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:43.570
You could have called for me, you know.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.250
Where is the Sinner Aion?

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:58.460
I, the Viscount Borzo, will myself
smash the traitor with a righteous blow!

00:19:58.460 --> 00:20:00.010
Please leave.

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.180
Stand back.

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.720
Lord Joshua...

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.890
Would you make some coffee or something?

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:09.680
I'll finish this up in no time.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:11.640
Shut up!

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.030
Impossible...

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:27.030
What are you?

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:35.920
Are you hurt?

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:37.590
I got cut a little.
